# No video verification

- Do not record the screen, do not save `.mp4` walkthroughs, do not call a
  `videoReview` subagent, do not use `RecordScreen`.
- Prove UI with tests, `curl`, or still screenshots only when a screenshot
  is required. A video is never required to close a task.
- Do not ask the user to watch a demo video. Do not block on filming.

```text
# BAD
RecordScreen START_RECORDING → click around → SAVE_RECORDING
CreateAgent subagent_type=videoReview

# GOOD
npm test / pytest, or one screenshot if the UI really changed
```
